[{"answer":"Hello. Children's Engineering Workshops.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I wanted some information about the workshops in the school holidays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I have two daughters who are interested.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The younger one's Lydia, she's four,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/6.mp3"},{"answer":"do you take children as young as that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/8.mp3"},{"answer":"our Tiny Engineers workshop is for four to five-year-olds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What sorts of activities do they do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/10.mp3"},{"answer":"All sorts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/11.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, they work together to design a special cover that goes round an egg,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/12.mp3"},{"answer":"so that when it's inside they can drop it from a height and it doesn't break.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, sometimes it does break but that's part of the fun!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/15.mp3"},{"answer":"And Lydia loves building things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there any opportunity for her to do that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they have a competition to see who can make the highest tower.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/18.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd be amazed how high they can go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/20.mp3"},{"answer":"But they're learning all the time as well as having fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/21.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, one thing they do is to design and build a car that's attached to a balloon,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and the force of the air in that actually powers the car and makes it move along.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/23.mp3"},{"answer":"They go really fast too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/24.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well, all this sounds perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Now Carly, that's my older daughter, has just had her seventh birthday,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/26.mp3"},{"answer":"so presumably she'd be in a different group?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, she'd be in the Junior Engineers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/28.mp3"},{"answer":"That's for children from six to eight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And do they do the same sorts of activities?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Some are the same, but a bit more advanced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/31.mp3"},{"answer":"So they work out how to build model vehicles,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/32.mp3"},{"answer":"things like cars and trucks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/33.mp3"},{"answer":"but also how to construct animals using the same sorts of material and technique,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and then they learn how they can program them and make them move.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/35.mp3"},{"answer":"So they learn a bit of coding?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/36.mp3"},{"answer":"They do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/37.mp3"},{"answer":"They pick it up really quickly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/38.mp3"},{"answer":"We're there to help if they need it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/39.mp3"},{"answer":"but they learn from one another too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/41.mp3"},{"answer":"And do they have competitions too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, with the Junior Engineers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/43.mp3"},{"answer":"it's to use recycled materials like card and wood to build a bridge,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and the longest one gets a prize.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/45.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't mind doing that myself!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Then they have something a bit different,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/48.mp3"},{"answer":"which is to think up an idea for a five-minute movie and then film it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/49.mp3"},{"answer":"using special animation software.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/50.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd be amazed what they come up with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/51.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, that's something they can put on their phone and take home to show all their friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And then they also build a robot in the shape of a human,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and they decorate it and program it so that it can move its arms and legs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/56.mp3"},{"answer":"So, is it the same price as the Tiny Engineers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just a bit more:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/58.mp3"},{"answer":"£50 for the five weeks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/59.mp3"},{"answer":"And are the classes on a Monday, too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/60.mp3"},{"answer":"They used to be,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/61.mp3"},{"answer":"but we found it didn't give our staff enough time to clear up after the first workshop,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/62.mp3"},{"answer":"so we moved them to Wednesdays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/63.mp3"},{"answer":"The classes are held in the morning from ten to eleven.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/64.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/65.mp3"},{"answer":"That's better for me actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about the location?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Where exactly are the workshops held?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/68.mp3"},{"answer":"They're in building 10A,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/69.mp3"},{"answer":"there's a big sign on the door, you can't miss it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/70-2023-07-25-15-31-37.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's in Fradstone Industrial Estate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Fradstone,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/73.mp3"},{"answer":"that's Fradstone","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/74.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's in Grasford, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, up past the station.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/76.mp3"},{"answer":"And will I have any parking problems there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/77.mp3"},{"answer":"No, there's always plenty available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/78.mp3"},{"answer":"So would you like to enrol Lydia and Carly now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/79.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/80.mp3"},{"answer":"So can I have...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-1-2022-12-28-23-21-22/81-2023-02-20-10-27-27.mp3"}]
